OL,3,GNEWSASpeed limit cut on major road over
OL,4,Asafety barrier fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a major road in Angus has seen
OL,7,Fits speed limit cut indefinitely after
OL,8,Fresurfacing work left a safety barrier
OL,9,F50mm (2in) too low.
OL,11,FThe stretch of the A90 between St Ann's
OL,12,Fand Keithock junctions, near Brechin,
OL,13,Fis usually a 70mph road.
OL,15,FHowever, drivers will be limited to
OL,16,Ftravelling at 50mph after the road was
OL,17,Fraised slightly during resurfacing,
OL,18,Fpotentially rendering the safety
OL,19,Fbarrier in its central reservation not
OL,20,Fhigh enough to protect people when
OL,21,Ftravelling at higher speeds.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
