OL,3,GNEWSASpeed limit cut on major road over
OL,4,Asafety barrier fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport Secretary Stephen Flynn said
OL,7,Fthe change would have a "minimal"
OL,8,Fimpact on drivers but did not set out a
OL,9,Ftimeline for when the issue would be
OL,10,Ffixed.
